WEBVTT


00:00:04.201 --> 00:00:05.680
I also didn't hear it


00:00:05.961 --> 00:00:07.997
What are you trying to do?


00:00:09.521 --> 00:00:10.351
Captain


00:00:11.481 --> 00:00:12.755
Are they still fighting across the river?


00:00:13.001 --> 00:00:15.071
Ls our Regiment still there?


00:00:16.121 --> 00:00:18.077
All our troops retreated long ago


00:00:20.801 --> 00:00:22.120
lf anyone dares run away


00:00:22.361 --> 00:00:23.874
My grenades will follow you


00:00:24.841 --> 00:00:26.240
Luo


00:00:26.481 --> 00:00:28.119
Since when did you become...


00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:29.555
so courageous?


00:00:29.721 --> 00:00:31.154
Back off!


00:00:33.361 --> 00:00:34.680
Sergeant Jiao


00:00:37.761 --> 00:00:41.231
Sergeant wants us to make it out alive


00:00:44.241 --> 00:00:47.119
Sergeant Jiao


00:00:47.401 --> 00:00:48.516
Sergeant Jiao!


00:00:55.841 --> 00:00:57.035
I never heard the bugle call


00:00:57.841 --> 00:00:58.910
I haven't heard a thing


00:01:00.761 --> 00:01:02.513
I can't order a retreat


00:01:03.481 --> 00:01:04.675
Sorry, guys


00:01:08.441 --> 00:01:10.397
Carry him into the mine


00:01:10.641 --> 00:01:12.359
Leave a space for me next to him


00:01:24.241 --> 00:01:25.913
Leave if you heard the call


00:01:26.161 --> 00:01:26.991
I won't stop you


00:01:27.961 --> 00:01:29.235
I didn't hear it, so I'm staying


00:01:30.561 --> 00:01:32.677
Let's get the explosives ready


00:01:37.001 --> 00:01:38.992
These were written by our dead brothers


00:01:39.281 --> 00:01:40.077
Some are martyrs


00:01:40.841 --> 00:01:41.830
The rest are mine


00:02:59.921 --> 00:03:00.876
Charge


00:03:02.361 --> 00:03:04.272
lf you're scared, start yelling


00:03:04.521 --> 00:03:05.431
lt works


00:03:23.241 --> 00:03:24.594
Two months later


00:03:24.881 --> 00:03:26.439
POW Ward, 8th Hospital, 3rd Field Army


00:03:26.481 --> 00:03:27.675
His wounds have healed well


00:03:27.961 --> 00:03:29.997
His hearing has nearly been
restored to normal


00:03:30.281 --> 00:03:32.476
Two of the three broken bones
have settled


00:03:32.721 --> 00:03:34.074
His shell shock is quite severe


00:03:34.321 --> 00:03:35.276
He is emotionally unstable


00:03:35.441 --> 00:03:36.556
Still unnerved from the trauma


00:03:36.761 --> 00:03:38.114
Over there


00:03:38.361 --> 00:03:39.077
Doctor Zhang


00:03:39.321 --> 00:03:40.436
Do you think he's telling the truth?


00:03:40.601 --> 00:03:41.511
Could he be lying on purpose?


00:03:43.161 --> 00:03:43.832
Lt's hard to tell


00:03:45.761 --> 00:03:47.433
But he's in a better mood today


00:03:54.841 --> 00:03:56.035
Wang, the noodles look good!


00:03:56.841 --> 00:03:57.876
I told you already


00:03:58.201 --> 00:03:59.350
My name isn't Wang


00:03:59.641 --> 00:04:01.472
Okay, I'm sorry


00:04:03.521 --> 00:04:04.670
Then what's your name?


00:04:04.961 --> 00:04:05.950
Gu Zidi


00:04:06.281 --> 00:04:07.714
As in. Son of the army.?


00:04:08.321 --> 00:04:09.037
Gu Zidi


00:04:09.281 --> 00:04:10.555
No, it means. Millet field.


00:04:10.801 --> 00:04:12.314
You should know


00:04:13.641 --> 00:04:15.233
The registration records are clear


00:04:15.321 --> 00:04:17.277
The 85th Army, 254th Division


00:04:17.401 --> 00:04:18.470
2nd Battalion, 5th Company, Private Wang


00:04:18.561 --> 00:04:20.153
That wasn't my uniform


00:04:20.201 --> 00:04:21.190
The name on the uniform


00:04:21.401 --> 00:04:22.550
Has nothing to do with me


00:04:22.841 --> 00:04:24.194
lt was never my uniform


00:04:24.401 --> 00:04:26.710
Then why were you wearing it?


00:04:27.681 --> 00:04:29.353
I already told you a thousand times


00:04:29.561 --> 00:04:30.471
lt was too late to retreat


00:04:30.641 --> 00:04:31.915
I was hiding out in an old mine


00:04:32.121 --> 00:04:33.440
I climbed out to look for something to eat


00:04:33.521 --> 00:04:35.034
Didn't I have to change my uniform?


00:04:36.961 --> 00:04:38.633
While I was looking for food


00:04:38.881 --> 00:04:40.314
I also blew up their ammo transport


00:04:40.561 --> 00:04:41.710
You blew out those tanks


00:04:42.641 --> 00:04:43.869
What about the letter?


00:04:45.321 --> 00:04:46.720
What are you laughing at?


00:04:46.921 --> 00:04:49.151
You want to screw with me, too?


00:04:50.201 --> 00:04:52.590
Lucky for you we didn't meet in battle


00:04:52.681 --> 00:04:53.955
You're blessed by your parent's
good deeds


00:04:54.201 --> 00:04:55.714
Go light incense for them


00:04:56.601 --> 00:04:57.636
What losers!


00:05:08.641 --> 00:05:10.154
You were captured on the Wen
River's south bank


00:05:10.401 --> 00:05:12.278
Will you admit to that much?


00:05:12.521 --> 00:05:14.751
I was in the advanced guard of
the 139th Battalion


00:05:15.001 --> 00:05:16.832
I was ordered to secure the south bank


00:05:17.041 --> 00:05:17.757
I was with my troops


00:05:17.841 --> 00:05:18.671
You mean.


00:05:18.921 --> 00:05:20.400
Before we took you prisoner


00:05:20.601 --> 00:05:21.875
The enemy had already taken you prisoner


00:05:23.041 --> 00:05:24.030
ls that right?


00:05:25.041 --> 00:05:25.632
Taken prisoner?


00:05:25.841 --> 00:05:26.512
Who?


00:05:27.561 --> 00:05:29.836
The unit you told me no longer exists


00:05:30.081 --> 00:05:32.072
All unit numbers were changed last year


00:05:32.121 --> 00:05:33.110
Didn't you know?


00:05:35.801 --> 00:05:37.871
The Central Plains Field Army
changed to the 2nd Field Army


00:05:38.081 --> 00:05:39.878
This hospital belongs to the
3rd Field Army


00:05:40.081 --> 00:05:41.639
lt was previously called the
Eastern China Field Army


00:05:41.921 --> 00:05:45.391
We can't find the Division you
said you belonged to


00:05:45.601 --> 00:05:46.750
We have no way to confirm what you say


00:05:46.961 --> 00:05:48.280
lt's also not the hospital's duty
to do so


00:05:50.361 --> 00:05:53.558
The 2nd and 3rd Field Divisions
are all preparing the next campaign


00:05:55.881 --> 00:05:57.473
Do you follow me?


00:05:58.641 --> 00:06:01.439
What do you mean?


00:06:02.521 --> 00:06:03.715
Stop messing around


00:06:04.041 --> 00:06:06.191
I sympathize with you but it won't help


00:06:08.161 --> 00:06:10.197
Your wounds have mostly healed


00:06:10.401 --> 00:06:11.629
Get your travel pay and hurry back home


00:06:11.681 --> 00:06:13.000
The hospital will issue you a pass


00:06:13.041 --> 00:06:14.633
Travel pay and passes are only
given to POWs


00:06:16.561 --> 00:06:17.391
You don't have to go home


00:06:17.601 --> 00:06:18.670
You can go look for your troops


00:06:18.721 --> 00:06:19.392
lf you think you can find them


00:06:20.201 --> 00:06:22.271
I entered the army in 1939


00:06:22.521 --> 00:06:24.876
I fought the Japs and then the
Nationalists


00:06:25.441 --> 00:06:26.112
Shit!


00:06:26.161 --> 00:06:26.957
L'll be real blunt


00:06:27.161 --> 00:06:28.480
This field hospital


00:06:28.721 --> 00:06:30.439
Can't verify your true identity


00:06:30.681 --> 00:06:32.990
You'll only be a burden to our hospital


00:06:33.281 --> 00:06:34.191
In addition


00:06:34.401 --> 00:06:36.119
What good would come of it for you?


00:06:40.321 --> 00:06:41.993
We've identified other men of your age


00:06:42.201 --> 00:06:43.031
Pretending to be a Private


00:06:43.281 --> 00:06:44.077
Some were Generals


00:06:44.161 --> 00:06:45.037
Others were Colonels


00:06:49.601 --> 00:06:51.114
I hope you'll recover soon


00:06:55.521 --> 00:06:56.636
Any artillery men?


00:06:58.121 --> 00:06:59.793
Has anyone served in artillery?


00:07:00.921 --> 00:07:02.354
You're all soldiers


00:07:02.641 --> 00:07:03.676
Reply


00:07:03.961 --> 00:07:05.030
Here


00:07:05.321 --> 00:07:05.958
I was.


00:07:06.161 --> 00:07:06.877
In artillery


00:07:29.721 --> 00:07:30.915
How many years were you in artillery?


00:07:32.721 --> 00:07:33.915
Not that long


00:07:35.081 --> 00:07:36.719
But long enough


00:07:37.001 --> 00:07:38.719
What kind of artillery have you used?


00:07:39.521 --> 00:07:40.397
The normal kind


00:07:40.681 --> 00:07:43.036
Barrels are at least.


00:07:45.681 --> 00:07:47.114
What artillery do you have here?


00:07:50.961 --> 00:07:51.871
Are you from Central Field?


00:07:52.721 --> 00:07:53.358
That's right


00:07:55.881 --> 00:07:57.155
And you have done artillery?


00:07:57.401 --> 00:07:58.880
Sure have


00:07:59.161 --> 00:08:00.753
I've even blown up tanks


00:08:01.801 --> 00:08:02.870
He doesn't seem like it


00:08:09.521 --> 00:08:12.160
What's the traverse range of a howitzer?


00:08:15.401 --> 00:08:18.199
Minus five degrees, straight 45 degrees


00:08:18.521 --> 00:08:20.113
This is the range for what?


00:08:23.241 --> 00:08:25.516
How old are you?


00:08:26.681 --> 00:08:28.080
Twenty?


00:08:28.401 --> 00:08:31.393
Our Captain fought the Japs in 1940


00:08:31.641 --> 00:08:32.756
He's been in the army as long as you


00:08:33.441 --> 00:08:34.032
Lieutenant


00:08:34.241 --> 00:08:35.196
Give him some money


00:08:36.081 --> 00:08:36.638
Tell him to scram


00:08:36.841 --> 00:08:37.478
Yes, sir


00:08:37.521 --> 00:08:38.556
You old dog


00:08:39.841 --> 00:08:40.671
Come on


00:08:46.161 --> 00:08:47.116
What's he laughing at?


00:08:47.881 --> 00:08:48.836
He's asking you


00:08:48.881 --> 00:08:49.552
Why are you laughing?


00:08:50.521 --> 00:08:53.479
One of my men used to eat
flapjacks like that


00:08:53.761 --> 00:08:55.353
He was always stuffing his mouth


00:09:04.401 --> 00:09:05.470
When the battle was over


00:09:06.601 --> 00:09:08.592
he ended up not making it


00:09:10.161 --> 00:09:11.640
Let him stay


00:09:26.961 --> 00:09:28.155
Yes, sir


00:09:30.401 --> 00:09:30.992
Understood


00:09:32.521 --> 00:09:33.510
Understood


00:09:35.001 --> 00:09:35.592
Yes, sir


00:09:36.921 --> 00:09:37.990
The American tanks


00:09:38.241 --> 00:09:39.754
Are assembling across the bridge


00:09:40.001 --> 00:09:40.672
The Division Commander


00:09:40.881 --> 00:09:42.155
Ordered us to get behind the enemy line


00:09:42.281 --> 00:09:43.316
And post a lookout


00:09:44.241 --> 00:09:45.230
We'll blow them to pieces


00:09:45.401 --> 00:09:46.834
Before the main attack


00:09:47.121 --> 00:09:47.792
Okay


00:09:48.001 --> 00:09:48.911
l'll go right over


00:09:49.161 --> 00:09:51.516
I need two men from the Scout Platoon


00:09:51.721 --> 00:09:54.281
The Scout Platoon is
out locating the enemy's front line


00:09:54.521 --> 00:09:55.795
Then transfer over two guards


00:09:55.921 --> 00:09:56.637
I will go, too


00:09:56.881 --> 00:09:58.599
I can't do much with artillery


00:09:58.801 --> 00:09:59.711
I can be of more use


00:09:59.921 --> 00:10:00.797
As a foot soldier


00:10:01.641 --> 00:10:02.278
Okay


00:10:02.521 --> 00:10:04.159
Get the enemy's uniform


00:10:04.401 --> 00:10:05.675
Then we can get up closer


00:10:05.761 --> 00:10:06.273
Understood


00:10:07.601 --> 00:10:08.590
The American's uniform?


00:10:09.161 --> 00:10:10.435
What?!


00:10:10.681 --> 00:10:11.955
Would you pass as one?


00:10:12.241 --> 00:10:13.469
Get the South Korean's


00:10:52.801 --> 00:10:54.029
Shit!


00:10:54.961 --> 00:10:56.280
I stepped on a mine


00:10:56.721 --> 00:10:58.234
Don't move


00:11:00.241 --> 00:11:02.072
Walk back along your footsteps


00:11:02.121 --> 00:11:03.349
Keep an eye on the road


00:11:07.601 --> 00:11:08.716
Don't come over


00:11:08.961 --> 00:11:10.792
lt won't explode unless you move your leg


00:11:14.601 --> 00:11:15.670
Don't worry about me


00:11:15.961 --> 00:11:17.440
Continue on with the others


00:11:18.481 --> 00:11:20.551
I wouldn't know which way to fire


00:11:21.481 --> 00:11:22.391
They know!


00:11:30.801 --> 00:11:32.200
A tank!


00:11:33.041 --> 00:11:34.440
An American tank!


00:11:35.361 --> 00:11:36.350
Just leave me


00:11:36.641 --> 00:11:38.040
Don't get yourselves killed


00:11:38.281 --> 00:11:38.952
Go!


00:11:39.241 --> 00:11:40.560
Put the guns down


00:11:40.841 --> 00:11:41.796
Put them down


00:11:43.161 --> 00:11:44.958
We are the allied troops


00:11:46.161 --> 00:11:47.879
Er Dou


00:11:48.161 --> 00:11:48.957
Relax


00:11:49.241 --> 00:11:50.799
This uniform decides if we make
it out alive


00:12:23.401 --> 00:12:25.278
But we don't know how to speak Korean


00:12:26.161 --> 00:12:27.071
We don't speak Korean


00:12:27.361 --> 00:12:29.591
The Americans speak even less


00:12:37.601 --> 00:12:39.080
Where's Hoengsong gun?


00:12:46.121 --> 00:12:48.476
How do we get to Hoengsong gun?


00:12:49.241 --> 00:12:51.516
(Chinese gibberish trying to sound Korean)


00:12:51.681 --> 00:12:52.272
No, no


00:12:52.521 --> 00:12:54.989
Where is Hoengsong gun?


00:12:55.281 --> 00:12:56.509
Hoengsong gun?


00:12:56.841 --> 00:12:57.478
Yeah, yeah


00:12:57.561 --> 00:12:58.118
Hoengsong gun


00:12:58.201 --> 00:12:59.236
Stop messing with him


00:12:59.481 --> 00:13:00.960
How do we get there?


00:13:01.161 --> 00:13:03.356
He stepped on a landmine


00:13:07.201 --> 00:13:09.840
He's on a landmine


00:13:20.801 --> 00:13:22.632
lt's not your lucky day


00:13:24.121 --> 00:13:26.271
Looks like a French anti personnel mine


00:13:27.281 --> 00:13:28.714
lf you're lucky


00:13:28.921 --> 00:13:31.515
Just the leg get blown off


00:13:31.761 --> 00:13:33.160
I know this will blow my leg off


00:13:34.321 --> 00:13:35.834
Well, good luck to you


00:13:36.081 --> 00:13:37.992
You're gonna need it


00:13:38.921 --> 00:13:40.673
Let's get out of here


00:13:40.961 --> 00:13:42.838
They have more things to worry
about than us


00:14:16.321 --> 00:14:17.390
Stay still


00:14:20.281 --> 00:14:22.192
Gu


00:14:24.081 --> 00:14:25.275
Stand still


00:14:48.921 --> 00:14:49.637
Stand still


00:14:50.241 --> 00:14:50.878
Lift up your foot


00:14:51.161 --> 00:14:52.150
Slowly


00:14:52.401 --> 00:14:54.312
What will happen?


00:14:54.961 --> 00:14:55.791
I've got a plan


00:14:56.401 --> 00:14:58.676
You are the eyes of dozens of cannons


00:14:59.641 --> 00:15:01.154
Lift your foot and walk away


00:15:01.801 --> 00:15:02.472
Faster


00:15:03.841 --> 00:15:05.593
lt might cost me a leg


00:15:07.241 --> 00:15:08.469
But you'll be blown to pieces


00:15:10.201 --> 00:15:12.795
You know what?


00:15:13.841 --> 00:15:15.638
I can't even hear the artillery sound


00:15:17.401 --> 00:15:19.551
The assembly call keeps ringing
in my ears


00:15:20.201 --> 00:15:21.600
lt never stops playing


00:15:23.921 --> 00:15:25.752
All my men heard it


00:15:26.641 --> 00:15:28.950
I was the only one who didn't


00:15:30.081 --> 00:15:31.400
I might as well be dead


00:15:31.681 --> 00:15:33.876
Then I could see my 47 brothers


00:15:33.921 --> 00:15:34.592
Man


00:15:37.041 --> 00:15:38.952
You can't die


00:15:40.241 --> 00:15:41.799
Hurry the fuck up


00:16:34.201 --> 00:16:35.554
Order the battalion to blow up the bridge


00:16:35.801 --> 00:16:37.041
Alm at 475


00:16:37.041 --> 00:16:38.190
075 to the right


00:16:38.401 --> 00:16:39.231
Fifth Company, four cannons


00:16:39.281 --> 00:16:39.872
Ready


00:16:40.121 --> 00:16:40.678
Fire


00:16:45.361 --> 00:16:46.589
Minus five


00:16:46.641 --> 00:16:47.551
003 to the left


00:16:47.641 --> 00:16:48.357
Fire


00:16:52.401 --> 00:16:53.081
On my command


00:16:53.081 --> 00:16:54.116
All fire


00:16:54.161 --> 00:16:54.832
Fire


00:17:09.241 --> 00:17:10.037
Captain


00:17:10.881 --> 00:17:11.996
Let's go


00:17:16.361 --> 00:17:18.238
Lead us out of here


00:17:20.081 --> 00:17:20.911
lf we don't go


00:17:20.961 --> 00:17:22.679
We'll all die


00:17:28.121 --> 00:17:29.315
lf the bugle hasn't sounded


00:17:29.601 --> 00:17:31.990
Even if you're the last man standing


00:17:32.241 --> 00:17:33.799
You must keep fighting


00:18:29.041 --> 00:18:29.996
Li Fucai


00:18:30.281 --> 00:18:31.077
Killed in action


00:18:31.321 --> 00:18:32.117
700 hundred pounds of rice


00:18:32.161 --> 00:18:32.877
Here


00:18:33.081 --> 00:18:37.472
Man Di, Zhang Wancai, Xu Fugui,
Zhang Shunxiang


00:18:37.721 --> 00:18:38.597
Missing in action


00:18:38.841 --> 00:18:39.398
200 hundred pounds


00:18:39.641 --> 00:18:40.471
They're not missing in action


00:18:40.681 --> 00:18:43.479
They were war heroes


00:18:44.481 --> 00:18:45.880
Five men came from my village


00:18:46.161 --> 00:18:47.276
Three got killed


00:18:47.521 --> 00:18:49.079
Two are deemed heroes


00:18:49.121 --> 00:18:49.712
And my brother?


00:18:49.921 --> 00:18:50.751
Missing in action


00:18:50.961 --> 00:18:51.996
That's not fair


00:18:52.241 --> 00:18:53.276
Yeah, so unfair


00:18:54.641 --> 00:18:55.357
Comrade


00:18:55.561 --> 00:18:56.471
Please be fair


00:18:56.721 --> 00:18:58.321
My brother didn't come home from the war


00:18:58.321 --> 00:18:59.276
Wasn't he killed in action?


00:19:00.321 --> 00:19:01.674
He's still dead either way


00:19:02.401 --> 00:19:04.631
But he's got to die for a reason


00:19:04.921 --> 00:19:07.594
The family of a hero gets 700
pounds of rice


00:19:07.841 --> 00:19:08.557
Families of the missing in action


00:19:08.641 --> 00:19:09.391
Get 200 pounds of rice only


00:19:09.641 --> 00:19:11.154
A difference of 500


00:19:13.161 --> 00:19:14.116
Sir


00:19:14.761 --> 00:19:15.671
What kind of gun is this?


00:19:16.361 --> 00:19:17.794
Haven't seen it before


00:19:21.721 --> 00:19:23.598
I wonder what this is


00:19:23.841 --> 00:19:24.637
Comrade


00:19:24.841 --> 00:19:25.796
Let me ask you a question


00:19:26.041 --> 00:19:27.315
Are you from the local military office?


00:19:27.521 --> 00:19:28.033
Yes


00:19:28.281 --> 00:19:31.114
Has anyone come looking for troops from


00:19:31.161 --> 00:19:32.435
Central Field's 2nd special division?


00:19:32.561 --> 00:19:33.232
Liu


00:19:33.961 --> 00:19:35.553
This is your department


00:19:35.801 --> 00:19:36.551
Have there been?


00:19:37.681 --> 00:19:38.955
Central Field's 2nd special division?


00:19:40.081 --> 00:19:41.355
So many troops have come back


00:19:41.561 --> 00:19:42.311
I can't remember


00:19:43.321 --> 00:19:44.151
Hey, Comrade


00:19:44.401 --> 00:19:45.231
Take a look at this


00:19:45.481 --> 00:19:46.596
What kind of gun is this?


00:19:48.441 --> 00:19:49.476
British 77


00:19:50.801 --> 00:19:53.315
I used this in guerrilla warfare in Pingxi


00:19:53.481 --> 00:19:54.231
Hard to use


00:19:58.041 --> 00:20:00.316
My husband's name was Wang Jincun


00:20:00.521 --> 00:20:03.354
Troops from our town saw him in
Yang village


00:20:03.601 --> 00:20:05.671
He was a teacher


00:20:05.921 --> 00:20:07.673
His letters said he didn't fight
in the front line


00:20:07.961 --> 00:20:08.711
In war, it doesn't really matter


00:20:08.881 --> 00:20:09.870
Whether you fought in the front
line or not


00:20:10.121 --> 00:20:11.634
He's either dead, ran away,
or taken prisoner


00:20:11.841 --> 00:20:12.876
That's why he's missing


00:20:13.081 --> 00:20:13.877
Comrade


00:20:14.121 --> 00:20:15.520
People from town keep gossiping


00:20:15.761 --> 00:20:17.672
And say he was executed by his own troops


00:20:18.641 --> 00:20:20.791
His mother died with shame


00:20:23.481 --> 00:20:24.197
Excuse me


00:20:24.481 --> 00:20:26.233
Your husband was Wang Jincun?


00:20:26.521 --> 00:20:27.397
Yes


00:20:27.641 --> 00:20:28.790
I was his Captain


00:20:32.121 --> 00:20:35.318
Battlefields lined both sides
of the Wen River


00:20:35.601 --> 00:20:37.956
Hundreds of thousands of troops
were assembled here


00:20:38.161 --> 00:20:39.921
And if all the reinforcements
were added together


00:20:39.921 --> 00:20:41.354
They'd outnumber everyone in
this county


00:20:42.641 --> 00:20:43.118
Of course


00:20:43.401 --> 00:20:44.880
Many people died


00:20:48.321 --> 00:20:50.039
This should be the place


00:20:50.721 --> 00:20:51.949
But it looks completely different


00:20:52.201 --> 00:20:52.792
Sir


00:20:53.081 --> 00:20:54.560
Any entrances to the old mine?


00:20:54.801 --> 00:20:56.200
There's one below, it collapsed


00:20:56.441 --> 00:20:57.321
Take me to it


00:20:57.321 --> 00:20:57.753
Let's go


00:21:34.641 --> 00:21:35.517
This isn't it


00:21:36.361 --> 00:21:37.714
Are there any other entrances?


00:21:37.881 --> 00:21:38.791
This is the only one left


00:21:39.001 --> 00:21:41.071
The others were destroyed in '52


00:21:41.841 --> 00:21:42.478
Were any bodies found?


00:21:42.681 --> 00:21:43.636
Not that I heard


00:21:47.401 --> 00:21:49.278
My men were all lying inside


00:21:50.121 --> 00:21:52.032
You didn't see them?


00:21:54.161 --> 00:21:56.391
They were all lying inside


00:21:56.601 --> 00:21:57.961
Why couldn't you see them?


00:21:57.961 --> 00:21:58.552
Gu


00:21:58.801 --> 00:21:59.597
Calm down


00:22:07.361 --> 00:22:08.874
Did you find this helmet here?


00:22:09.081 --> 00:22:10.673
This? We've got tons of them


00:22:10.921 --> 00:22:12.832
The miners pee in them at night


00:22:14.561 --> 00:22:17.155
These were worn on the heads of soldiers


00:22:18.121 --> 00:22:19.634
And you pee in them!


00:22:19.681 --> 00:22:20.557
Gu!


00:22:22.361 --> 00:22:23.077
Miss


00:22:24.641 --> 00:22:25.676
Don't listen to them


00:22:25.921 --> 00:22:27.639
Your husband was a good man


00:22:27.881 --> 00:22:28.996
I can prove it


00:22:30.081 --> 00:22:30.957
I can prove it


00:22:31.801 --> 00:22:33.075
He shed his blood on this soil


00:22:33.121 --> 00:22:33.997
I can prove it


00:22:34.961 --> 00:22:36.280
Gu


00:22:36.841 --> 00:22:37.557
Gu


00:22:37.641 --> 00:22:38.994
I will prove that my brothers


00:22:39.201 --> 00:22:40.714
Are buried under this mountain of coal


00:22:40.921 --> 00:22:42.320
I will prove it to them


00:22:44.081 --> 00:22:45.560
l'll prove it


00:22:48.721 --> 00:22:50.757
He was studying at the provincial
teacher's college


00:22:51.841 --> 00:22:53.911
He left without saying a word


00:22:55.361 --> 00:22:56.714
His mother missed him so much


00:22:56.921 --> 00:22:57.910
She became ill


00:22:58.161 --> 00:23:00.516
And never got out of bed again


00:23:02.001 --> 00:23:02.751
At first


00:23:03.001 --> 00:23:05.071
We received letters from him


00:23:06.641 --> 00:23:08.279
After receiving his last letter


00:23:08.481 --> 00:23:09.960
On August 13, 1948


00:23:11.001 --> 00:23:13.117
I never heard from him again


00:23:15.601 --> 00:23:16.636
He wrote to you everyday


00:23:17.921 --> 00:23:20.037
His clothes were filled with letters


00:23:25.081 --> 00:23:25.991
Please


00:23:29.001 --> 00:23:30.832
Tell me how he died


00:23:31.961 --> 00:23:33.076
Please tell me


00:23:36.521 --> 00:23:38.193
He was very clean


00:23:38.481 --> 00:23:41.234
His hair was always perfectly combed


00:23:41.481 --> 00:23:44.075
He looked the same when he died


00:23:45.401 --> 00:23:47.517
He was hit by a tiny bit of shrapnel


00:23:53.521 --> 00:23:56.035
About this big. On a fatal spot


00:23:57.841 --> 00:23:59.797
You couldn't see the wound


00:24:00.081 --> 00:24:01.480
He looked as if he was sleeping


00:24:03.041 --> 00:24:04.997
His hair looked perfect


00:24:55.601 --> 00:24:57.000
Gu


00:24:57.881 --> 00:24:59.030
There's no point in looking


00:25:01.521 --> 00:25:02.670
Not a single one has a name


00:25:04.961 --> 00:25:06.394
They're all anonymous soldiers


00:25:14.041 --> 00:25:16.396
Their parents gave them names


00:25:21.801 --> 00:25:24.269
How did they become nameless men?


00:26:45.001 --> 00:26:45.751
Where is he?


00:26:45.881 --> 00:26:46.521
Reporting, sir!


00:26:46.521 --> 00:26:47.840
He's squatting over there


00:26:50.881 --> 00:26:51.791
Er Dou


00:26:52.081 --> 00:26:52.877
I've come to see you


00:26:53.801 --> 00:26:56.395
Of course, why else would you come?


00:26:59.361 --> 00:27:00.476
Easy does it, Flapjack


00:27:00.681 --> 00:27:02.034
You know you're going blind


00:27:02.081 --> 00:27:03.833
What if you fell into the river?
Not so hard


00:27:03.881 --> 00:27:05.712
Why didn't you tell me you were coming?


00:27:05.961 --> 00:27:07.314
Not so hard, you'll choke me


00:27:07.521 --> 00:27:08.795
Your troops are watching


00:27:09.001 --> 00:27:10.070
What are you smiling at?


00:27:10.361 --> 00:27:11.396
No smiling allowed


00:27:11.681 --> 00:27:12.352
Yes, sir


00:27:13.361 --> 00:27:14.760
Don't forget


00:27:16.601 --> 00:27:18.239
This is my blood brother


00:27:22.641 --> 00:27:23.153
Who is that?


00:27:23.241 --> 00:27:23.559
Come over


00:27:23.601 --> 00:27:24.477
Let me introduce you


00:27:25.561 --> 00:27:26.391
Sun Guiqin


00:27:26.641 --> 00:27:27.790
My Political Officer's wife


00:27:28.481 --> 00:27:29.118
Hello


00:27:29.361 --> 00:27:30.032
I'm Zhao Erdou


00:27:30.561 --> 00:27:31.277
Hello


00:27:31.721 --> 00:27:33.279
He's the Colonel I told you about


00:27:33.481 --> 00:27:34.596
He's just like me, uneducated


00:27:34.841 --> 00:27:36.274
In artillery school,
he could never sleep


00:27:36.361 --> 00:27:37.510
He ended up getting kicked out


00:27:37.801 --> 00:27:39.154
I applied to leave


00:27:39.241 --> 00:27:40.196
Stop making things up!


00:27:41.521 --> 00:27:44.399
She went to the County looking
for her late husband


00:27:44.641 --> 00:27:47.394
How could she find him if I couldn't?


00:27:47.641 --> 00:27:49.518
I brought her here to ask for your help


00:27:49.601 --> 00:27:50.511
I know you can help


00:27:50.801 --> 00:27:52.234
How can I help?


00:27:52.481 --> 00:27:54.153
She has a fever


00:27:54.241 --> 00:27:55.959
Must have gotten sick from the rain


00:27:56.161 --> 00:27:57.958
Hurry and help get her stuff


00:27:58.841 --> 00:28:00.911
Zhao


00:28:01.201 --> 00:28:01.838
Get the car


00:28:32.641 --> 00:28:33.710
ls her temperature down?


00:28:35.401 --> 00:28:36.151
Lt's down


00:28:37.201 --> 00:28:38.350
lt was over forty degrees


00:28:38.641 --> 00:28:39.835
Scary


00:28:40.561 --> 00:28:41.471
You haven't slept?


00:28:42.241 --> 00:28:43.310
I dozed off


00:28:45.801 --> 00:28:47.280
I had them make some noodles


00:28:53.201 --> 00:28:53.997
What are you laughing at?


00:28:54.841 --> 00:28:56.877
That's for the girl


00:28:57.121 --> 00:28:59.476
But you didn't bother to
ask if I'm hungry?


00:29:00.761 --> 00:29:01.830
Take it


00:29:02.201 --> 00:29:03.236
l'll order some more


00:29:03.521 --> 00:29:04.840
lt's no big deal


00:29:05.361 --> 00:29:06.680
Relax


00:29:06.961 --> 00:29:08.394
I'm just messing with you


00:29:13.481 --> 00:29:14.357
Flapjack


00:29:15.321 --> 00:29:17.881
I came to ask for three favors


00:29:18.761 --> 00:29:21.639
First get me another job transfer


00:29:21.921 --> 00:29:24.071
I'm not going home


00:29:24.361 --> 00:29:27.592
A retirement home for veterans
was built by the Wen River


00:29:27.841 --> 00:29:28.956
Forget it


00:29:30.321 --> 00:29:32.232
You can't stay in a place like that


00:29:32.481 --> 00:29:34.312
lt'll turn you into a ghost


00:29:36.401 --> 00:29:37.595
lf you don't want to go back home


00:29:39.161 --> 00:29:41.959
Transfer your work papers here


00:29:42.881 --> 00:29:44.872
You can stay with me


00:29:45.841 --> 00:29:46.910
You're not my son!


00:29:47.121 --> 00:29:48.076
Why should I stay with you?


00:29:48.361 --> 00:29:49.919
You can be my godfather, okay?


00:29:53.081 --> 00:29:55.754
A piece of that landmine is lodged
in your skull


00:29:56.041 --> 00:29:57.918
Sooner or later you'll go completely
blind


00:29:58.201 --> 00:29:59.236
What will you do then?


00:30:02.201 --> 00:30:03.270
No more bullshit


00:30:04.321 --> 00:30:05.390
Stay here


00:30:06.161 --> 00:30:08.277
Stay with my regiment


00:30:08.521 --> 00:30:09.510
Do whatever you want here


00:30:09.761 --> 00:30:11.319
Look at your power


00:30:11.601 --> 00:30:12.272
Go on


00:30:13.641 --> 00:30:15.791
In North Korea, you made a
promise to me.


00:30:16.081 --> 00:30:18.390
You said you'd help me find my
troops after the war


00:30:19.401 --> 00:30:20.800
Gu


00:30:22.841 --> 00:30:24.399
Millions of soldiers


00:30:24.681 --> 00:30:28.515
Troops who lost entered new units


00:30:30.481 --> 00:30:32.676
Even if we think the world of ourselves


00:30:33.001 --> 00:30:36.038
We're just like drops in a river


00:30:36.401 --> 00:30:39.120
Why would they care about us?


00:30:39.401 --> 00:30:40.629
They don't care


00:30:40.961 --> 00:30:42.360
We must care about it


00:30:44.241 --> 00:30:45.799
Tell me the truth


00:30:46.041 --> 00:30:47.440
That report I made


00:30:47.681 --> 00:30:49.353
Did you ever pass it up the line?


00:30:49.641 --> 00:30:50.790
Of course I did


00:30:51.041 --> 00:30:52.952
But l'll bet it just got stuck
in the pile


00:30:54.761 --> 00:30:55.591
They said


00:30:55.881 --> 00:30:57.997
The headquarters received many
letters like yours


00:30:58.241 --> 00:31:00.197
Hundreds of thousands of them


00:31:00.521 --> 00:31:01.636
They couldn't open them all


00:31:04.401 --> 00:31:05.834
Be patient


00:31:11.641 --> 00:31:12.710
ls she awake?


00:31:12.961 --> 00:31:13.950
Not yet


00:31:14.281 --> 00:31:15.111
Report when she's awake


00:31:15.201 --> 00:31:16.111
Yes, Colonel


00:31:21.561 --> 00:31:23.119
I've said the first two


00:31:24.681 --> 00:31:26.114
There's one more


00:31:28.721 --> 00:31:29.790
Brother


00:31:30.081 --> 00:31:32.037
I found a wife for you


00:31:34.841 --> 00:31:35.751
Who?


00:31:37.201 --> 00:31:38.759
She's down with a fever


00:31:40.481 --> 00:31:42.278
Stop kidding around!


00:31:42.521 --> 00:31:44.000
How about it?


00:31:44.321 --> 00:31:45.390
You don't like her because
she's a widow?


00:31:45.681 --> 00:31:46.511
Nonsense


00:31:46.761 --> 00:31:48.080
I'm no golden boy myself


00:31:49.361 --> 00:31:51.431
lt's just not right


00:31:51.521 --> 00:31:52.476
Seems right to me


00:31:52.681 --> 00:31:54.080
I think you should be with her


00:31:55.081 --> 00:31:56.241
We're brothers


00:31:56.241 --> 00:31:57.196
So l'll be blunt


00:31:57.961 --> 00:32:00.316
A blind person doesn't deserve
such a woman


00:32:00.521 --> 00:32:01.431
lt wouldn't be fair to her


00:32:03.921 --> 00:32:04.910
Tell me


00:32:05.161 --> 00:32:06.594
What does her face look like?


00:32:08.401 --> 00:32:09.754
A beauty


00:32:11.321 --> 00:32:12.959
I can't see clearly what she
looks like


00:32:13.761 --> 00:32:15.797
lf she is so beautiful


00:32:16.121 --> 00:32:17.998
lt's a waste to leave her with me


00:32:33.841 --> 00:32:36.196
Tell her what you should


00:32:37.281 --> 00:32:38.396
lf you can't find the words


00:32:38.641 --> 00:32:40.597
l'll talk to her when she's better,


00:32:41.521 --> 00:32:43.000
Listen to your brother


00:32:43.281 --> 00:32:44.794
She cherishes a loved one that's
passed away


00:32:45.081 --> 00:32:47.197
She will devote herself to a
living one


00:33:03.721 --> 00:33:04.437
Gu


00:33:04.481 --> 00:33:05.072
Yes?


00:33:06.601 --> 00:33:07.750
What do you want for dinner?


00:33:07.961 --> 00:33:09.030
Dumplings


00:33:09.481 --> 00:33:11.949
lf during the holidays


00:33:12.121 --> 00:33:14.589
A few of us friends


00:33:14.841 --> 00:33:18.151
Can celebrate together


00:33:19.561 --> 00:33:22.678
We will remember


00:33:22.881 --> 00:33:25.111
All the memories we treasure


00:33:25.281 --> 00:33:28.557
A song filled with joy


00:33:30.161 --> 00:33:32.880
We will remember


00:33:33.121 --> 00:33:35.396
All the memories we treasure


00:33:35.601 --> 00:33:38.752
A song filled with joy


00:33:40.561 --> 00:33:41.437
At the end of the battle


00:33:41.641 --> 00:33:43.518
You were the only one left standing?


00:33:43.801 --> 00:33:44.472
That's right


00:33:44.761 --> 00:33:46.399
I was the only one left


00:33:47.921 --> 00:33:49.877
How'd you get the enemy's uniform?


00:33:51.121 --> 00:33:52.634
What?


00:33:53.601 --> 00:33:55.034
We need to know in detail


00:33:55.241 --> 00:33:56.674
the order of events


00:34:01.601 --> 00:34:02.636
After all this time


00:34:03.521 --> 00:34:05.637
You are still missing the point


00:34:06.721 --> 00:34:08.598
Since you claimed to be the only
one alive


00:34:08.841 --> 00:34:10.991
Who is to verify your story?


00:34:12.721 --> 00:34:13.836
What else do you want to know?


00:34:14.081 --> 00:34:15.275
Just tell me


00:34:15.561 --> 00:34:16.755
I want to hear it out


00:34:18.641 --> 00:34:19.960
Suppose


00:34:20.041 --> 00:34:22.350
You intentionally snuck into the
enemy's ranks


00:34:22.561 --> 00:34:24.199
How did you do it?


00:34:24.441 --> 00:34:25.590
Why did you do it?


00:34:26.401 --> 00:34:28.869
What were you thinking?


00:34:29.161 --> 00:34:31.197
Did you consider the consequences?


00:34:32.081 --> 00:34:33.958
We hope you will take these
questions seriously


00:34:34.081 --> 00:34:34.831
The Party needs to make the
record straight


00:34:35.041 --> 00:34:36.599
And you need to make the record
straight


00:34:39.121 --> 00:34:41.157
Your employment is registered
in our county


00:34:41.801 --> 00:34:43.996
lt is our duty to review our cadres


00:34:45.001 --> 00:34:46.150
Comrade Gu Zidi


00:34:47.081 --> 00:34:47.877
Take your time


00:34:48.801 --> 00:34:50.234
Before you answer


00:34:50.521 --> 00:34:51.397
Think it through


00:34:51.721 --> 00:34:52.915
Try to remember


00:34:53.201 --> 00:34:54.077
No rush


00:34:55.561 --> 00:34:57.233
I've said all I can say


00:34:58.321 --> 00:35:00.312
What else do you want to know?


00:35:00.601 --> 00:35:02.353
Please answer the questions
I just asked


00:35:03.241 --> 00:35:04.276
Fuck you


00:35:04.481 --> 00:35:05.197
What did you say?


00:35:05.481 --> 00:35:06.994
I said, fuck you


00:35:07.241 --> 00:35:08.594
Watch your mouth


00:35:08.841 --> 00:35:09.910
Comrade Gu


00:35:10.121 --> 00:35:11.315
You must calm down


00:35:11.561 --> 00:35:14.200
You are full of shit,
and I am to be calm?


00:35:14.481 --> 00:35:16.551
You are responsible for your
words and actions


00:35:16.801 --> 00:35:17.995
I've already died hundreds of time


00:35:18.201 --> 00:35:19.793
Who cares about this bullshit?


00:35:20.681 --> 00:35:21.557
Write this down


00:35:21.721 --> 00:35:23.120
Take down what he just said


00:35:23.401 --> 00:35:24.880
Don't just take down my words


00:35:25.121 --> 00:35:28.238
Write this down as well


00:35:29.361 --> 00:35:30.396
He can take care of himself


00:35:35.801 --> 00:35:37.519
Absolutely ridiculous!


00:35:37.681 --> 00:35:38.750
He's got a bad temper


00:35:38.921 --> 00:35:39.561
Wang


00:35:39.561 --> 00:35:40.710
See the two officials off


00:35:43.921 --> 00:35:45.195
Give my regards to the Director


00:35:59.881 --> 00:36:00.597
Gu


00:36:01.401 --> 00:36:02.720
Try to cooperate


00:36:03.641 --> 00:36:04.596
Don't be like this


00:36:05.641 --> 00:36:06.391
lt's not fair


00:36:08.001 --> 00:36:09.036
lt's so unfair


00:36:35.161 --> 00:36:36.310
Gu


00:36:36.401 --> 00:36:37.311
You can't see your way around


00:36:37.521 --> 00:36:38.431
Don't come up here


00:36:38.681 --> 00:36:40.399
My eyesight is poor, but my nose is keen


00:36:40.641 --> 00:36:42.120
lf the forest caught on fire


00:36:42.361 --> 00:36:43.077
You wouldn't see it


00:36:43.321 --> 00:36:44.754
But I'd be able to smell it


00:37:04.001 --> 00:37:04.751
Nice view


00:37:07.121 --> 00:37:08.713
Gu


00:37:14.521 --> 00:37:15.237
Gu


00:37:15.321 --> 00:37:16.549
Look towards the road


00:37:16.841 --> 00:37:18.354
Gu


00:37:20.801 --> 00:37:22.553
Gu


00:37:23.321 --> 00:37:24.071
They've been found


00:37:25.441 --> 00:37:26.874
What's been found?


00:37:27.401 --> 00:37:28.834
Er Dou just got the notice!


00:37:29.121 --> 00:37:29.917
Gu


00:37:30.201 --> 00:37:31.919
They found your old regiment


00:37:49.321 --> 00:37:50.037
My girl


00:37:50.321 --> 00:37:51.913
Er Dou isn't fooling around with me?


00:37:52.241 --> 00:37:54.072
No, it's true


00:37:55.641 --> 00:37:57.597
You mustn't fool around


00:37:57.841 --> 00:37:58.398
lt's true


00:37:58.681 --> 00:38:00.194
Come back with me


00:38:03.841 --> 00:38:05.513
What's wrong?


00:38:06.601 --> 00:38:08.432
Be careful


00:38:08.601 --> 00:38:09.272
lt's true


00:38:09.361 --> 00:38:12.558
You must not fool around


00:38:24.881 --> 00:38:25.597
Director Qin


00:38:25.801 --> 00:38:26.756
Thanks for waiting


00:38:28.081 --> 00:38:28.911
Colonel Zhao


00:38:29.201 --> 00:38:29.713
Thanks for coming


00:38:29.961 --> 00:38:31.758
This is the person I told you about


00:38:32.041 --> 00:38:33.190
Our battalion's hero


00:38:33.481 --> 00:38:34.277
Volunteer soldier, Bronze Star
for distinguished service


00:38:34.561 --> 00:38:35.232
Flapjack


00:38:35.441 --> 00:38:37.159
lt would be better to say


00:38:38.201 --> 00:38:40.271
I'm the Central Plains Field Army's
Special 2nd Division


00:38:40.521 --> 00:38:42.910
139th Battalion, 3rd Regiment,
9th Company,
Captain Gu Zidi


00:38:43.201 --> 00:38:44.953
I've come to report to Colonel Liu


00:38:45.201 --> 00:38:47.874
This is Director Qin from the
Chemical Defense Regiment


00:38:48.121 --> 00:38:50.237
He is handling the cases associated
with the 139th Regiment


00:38:50.841 --> 00:38:51.398
Comrade Gu


00:38:51.681 --> 00:38:53.399
On behalf of the regiment's
Political Officers


00:38:53.641 --> 00:38:54.312
I welcome you


00:38:54.921 --> 00:38:57.071
Your regiment is the same as
the old 139th Regiment?


00:38:57.401 --> 00:38:58.311
Not entirely


00:38:58.601 --> 00:38:59.795
Our regiment now includes


00:39:00.041 --> 00:39:02.032
Part of the Western Henan's
Training Corps


00:39:02.241 --> 00:39:04.197
And a part of the old 139th Regiment


00:39:04.481 --> 00:39:06.915
We haven't been able to handle all of
the Regiment's cases


00:39:07.161 --> 00:39:10.392
We checked the MIA name list
from the Wen River mission


00:39:10.641 --> 00:39:12.757
Your name was listed


00:39:13.041 --> 00:39:16.511
Colonel Liu was transferred to
the Branch Military Cadre Academy


00:39:16.601 --> 00:39:17.716
As the Deputy Commandant


00:39:17.921 --> 00:39:19.400
After the Korean War started


00:39:19.441 --> 00:39:20.669
He re entered combat duties


00:39:20.761 --> 00:39:22.479
As Deputy Commander of the 280th Division


00:39:28.641 --> 00:39:29.676
Gu.


00:39:31.401 --> 00:39:32.197
Captain Gu


00:39:37.521 --> 00:39:38.237
You are?


00:39:38.401 --> 00:39:39.072
Me?


00:39:40.321 --> 00:39:41.390
I'm Liangzi


00:39:42.241 --> 00:39:44.311
I am managing the Memorial Cemetery here


00:39:45.401 --> 00:39:47.392
You don't recognize my voice?


00:39:49.241 --> 00:39:52.472
I was the regiment's Bugler


00:39:54.321 --> 00:39:55.595
You twerp


00:39:57.201 --> 00:39:58.953
You're still alive


00:40:07.401 --> 00:40:09.073
During the fifth campaign


00:40:09.881 --> 00:40:11.758
He led two infantry battalions


00:40:12.041 --> 00:40:13.315
To cover the division's retreat


00:40:14.201 --> 00:40:16.112
When it came time for our own retreat


00:40:16.361 --> 00:40:17.589
lt was already too late


00:40:19.601 --> 00:40:21.637
More than five hundred men died


00:40:21.921 --> 00:40:24.151
Only thirty escaped alive


00:40:26.721 --> 00:40:28.837
His back was blown apart


00:40:30.721 --> 00:40:32.120
I had to carry him back


00:40:33.561 --> 00:40:35.791
He was in the hospital for more
than half a month


00:40:37.481 --> 00:40:38.550
But he didn't make it


00:40:40.161 --> 00:40:41.560
Why not retreat earlier?


00:40:42.241 --> 00:40:43.356
The transmitter had been destroyed


00:40:44.121 --> 00:40:45.713
We never received the retreat order


00:40:46.041 --> 00:40:47.190
We couldn't do anything about it


00:40:47.841 --> 00:40:50.674
They could only keep pounding forward


00:40:51.441 --> 00:40:53.511
He's one tough son of a bitch


00:40:53.761 --> 00:40:55.240
Trained by the old school


00:40:55.521 --> 00:40:57.000
Stubborn ass


00:41:04.401 --> 00:41:05.117
Liangzi


00:41:06.481 --> 00:41:09.518
No one sent to the old mine survived


00:41:10.481 --> 00:41:12.039
How did the Regiment evaluate this?


00:41:13.081 --> 00:41:15.549
After the battle, Commissar Zhang
inspected the area himself


00:41:15.801 --> 00:41:17.598
He couldn't find anyone, dead or alive


00:41:17.881 --> 00:41:19.997
Everyone was listed as MIA


00:41:22.401 --> 00:41:23.390
My ears belong on pigs


00:41:24.361 --> 00:41:26.397
I never heard your assembly bugle call


00:41:27.561 --> 00:41:29.233
Some troops heard it


00:41:29.481 --> 00:41:30.709
But I never heard it


00:41:32.241 --> 00:41:33.879
I've always felt guilty about this


00:41:35.721 --> 00:41:38.394
But I never blew the assembly call


00:41:44.041 --> 00:41:46.032
They all heard it


00:41:46.241 --> 00:41:47.310
I never played it


00:41:54.041 --> 00:41:55.030
Gu


00:41:56.321 --> 00:41:58.039
l'll tell you one more time


00:42:00.041 --> 00:42:02.680
I never played the assembly bugle call


00:42:05.241 --> 00:42:06.594
Why not?


00:42:08.241 --> 00:42:10.630
The Regiment suddenly received
the order to retreat


00:42:10.921 --> 00:42:11.671
At that time


00:42:11.921 --> 00:42:13.513
You were in the old mine


00:42:13.761 --> 00:42:15.911
Holding up a lot of the enemy


00:42:16.201 --> 00:42:18.476
lf we ordered your retreat


00:42:18.761 --> 00:42:21.036
The entire regiment may have
been in serious trouble


00:42:21.321 --> 00:42:22.197
Perhaps


00:42:22.441 --> 00:42:24.238
Even wiped out by the enemy


00:42:25.921 --> 00:42:26.876
Colonel Liu


00:42:28.721 --> 00:42:30.598
Never ordered the assembly call
to be sounded


00:42:36.241 --> 00:42:38.038
You were afraid of being wiped out?


00:42:39.521 --> 00:42:41.477
You were afraid of being wiped out?


00:42:42.081 --> 00:42:42.752
What about us?


00:42:43.201 --> 00:42:44.236
The 9th Company!


00:42:45.121 --> 00:42:45.951
Gu


00:42:47.401 --> 00:42:48.959
Liu!


00:42:49.041 --> 00:42:49.598
Gu!


00:42:49.841 --> 00:42:51.797
The Colonel felt terrible about this


00:42:52.521 --> 00:42:54.273
Even on his death bed


00:42:54.841 --> 00:42:57.196
He talked about nothing but you


00:42:57.481 --> 00:42:59.121
I was with the Colonel for more
than ten years


00:42:59.121 --> 00:43:00.031
He was a good person!


00:43:00.281 --> 00:43:01.509
Blame me instead


00:43:01.721 --> 00:43:02.517
I never played the Assembly


00:43:02.761 --> 00:43:04.479
Not for the Colonel nor for
the 9th Company


00:43:04.681 --> 00:43:05.796
I'm so sorry


00:43:06.481 --> 00:43:07.041
Gu!


00:43:07.041 --> 00:43:07.757
Liu!


00:43:07.801 --> 00:43:09.393
The Colonel is dead


00:43:09.681 --> 00:43:11.672
The Colonel is dead


00:43:11.961 --> 00:43:13.713
You were afraid of being wiped out!


00:43:14.441 --> 00:43:16.591
The entire 9th Company was wiped out!


00:43:16.841 --> 00:43:18.593
Let me apologize for the Colonel


00:43:18.881 --> 00:43:20.801
I am the only one left I beg you


00:43:20.801 --> 00:43:21.870
Brothers of the 9th company


00:43:22.081 --> 00:43:24.311
Colonel Liu offers his deepest apologies


00:43:24.601 --> 00:43:27.320
I wish I was wiped out long ago


00:43:29.081 --> 00:43:30.150
Damn Liu


00:43:30.441 --> 00:43:32.193
I was waiting for your bugle call!


00:43:32.481 --> 00:43:35.154
My men were always waiting for your call!


00:43:35.401 --> 00:43:37.710
They died one by one.


00:43:37.961 --> 00:43:39.633
Waiting for your call!


00:43:42.561 --> 00:43:43.471
Gu Zidi!


00:43:44.321 --> 00:43:46.357
Why can't you just let go


00:43:48.241 --> 00:43:50.232
People die, it's part of war


00:43:50.841 --> 00:43:53.275
Lots of soldiers died,
not just your company


00:43:53.521 --> 00:43:54.271
Let me remind you


00:43:54.521 --> 00:43:56.079
I was Colonel Liu's bodyguard


00:43:56.281 --> 00:43:57.794
I still am to this day


00:43:58.121 --> 00:43:59.839
lf you don't stop this nonsense


00:44:00.041 --> 00:44:02.111
l'll rip your head off


00:44:02.361 --> 00:44:03.555
What are you doing?


00:44:03.881 --> 00:44:05.200
This is the Memorial Cemetery


00:44:10.121 --> 00:44:11.236
I didn't want you to go down the road


00:44:11.521 --> 00:44:12.670
But you would not listen


00:44:13.561 --> 00:44:15.233
Aren't you just picking on your
own wound?


00:44:20.961 --> 00:44:22.599
All his men died


00:44:23.801 --> 00:44:26.395
He's been searching for them
all these years


00:44:26.721 --> 00:44:29.076
He won't hurt anyone by shouting


00:44:35.161 --> 00:44:37.356
What's done is done


00:44:38.961 --> 00:44:39.871
Don't bring it up again


00:44:41.041 --> 00:44:42.269
You, too


00:44:44.601 --> 00:44:45.317
Calm down


00:45:17.241 --> 00:45:18.037
Liu my man


00:45:21.601 --> 00:45:22.636
I'm not.


00:45:24.521 --> 00:45:25.874
I can take the fact...


00:45:27.161 --> 00:45:28.310
that the call wasn't sounded


00:45:32.521 --> 00:45:33.476
But all my men


00:45:34.721 --> 00:45:36.313
My forty seven brothers


00:45:39.401 --> 00:45:41.153
All fought to death bravely


00:45:43.281 --> 00:45:45.875
How could they be called MIA?


00:45:49.321 --> 00:45:51.357
You are buried here


00:45:52.441 --> 00:45:55.114
Who can prove what really happened?


00:45:57.361 --> 00:45:58.999
Repeat the orders


00:46:03.041 --> 00:46:04.633
By tomorrow twelve noon


00:46:04.921 --> 00:46:06.479
No matter what it takes


00:46:06.721 --> 00:46:08.393
We must secure the old mine on
the southern bank


00:46:08.761 --> 00:46:09.591
What else?


00:46:09.841 --> 00:46:11.832
Always listen. For the Assembly
bugle call


00:46:11.921 --> 00:46:12.956
Fall back when you hear it


00:46:15.881 --> 00:46:16.757
Liu


00:46:18.201 --> 00:46:19.520
Have a good rest


00:46:22.281 --> 00:46:26.832
l'll bring you cigarettes and
wine from now on


00:46:28.401 --> 00:46:30.039
We share the same fate


00:46:31.121 --> 00:46:32.395
You owe me nothing


00:46:32.761 --> 00:46:34.717
I also owe you nothing


00:46:35.041 --> 00:46:37.714
We are even now


00:47:48.721 --> 00:47:49.551
What are you digging for?


00:47:50.481 --> 00:47:51.709
Bodies


00:47:52.041 --> 00:47:53.030
What bodies?


00:47:53.921 --> 00:47:54.751
Dead bodies


00:48:03.121 --> 00:48:04.440
Do you have permission from the mine?


00:48:04.721 --> 00:48:05.471
Let go


00:48:08.881 --> 00:48:10.519
What are you really up to?


00:48:11.281 --> 00:48:12.236
Did you ask for permission?


00:48:16.121 --> 00:48:17.679
Lf you didn't, then you can't dig here


00:48:21.401 --> 00:48:22.038
Let go of me


00:48:22.961 --> 00:48:23.916
You can't dig here


00:48:24.161 --> 00:48:25.037
Let go


00:48:28.801 --> 00:48:30.871
This old soldier has lost his mind


00:48:31.121 --> 00:48:31.997
He's crazy


00:48:34.441 --> 00:48:36.193
This old man is crazy


00:48:57.881 --> 00:48:58.950
Comrade Gu Zidi


00:49:00.081 --> 00:49:02.356
You're obstructing the mine's
economic development


00:49:03.241 --> 00:49:04.674
You are a decorated veteran


00:49:04.961 --> 00:49:06.633
You should know better


00:49:06.921 --> 00:49:07.956
lt's been more than a month


00:49:08.201 --> 00:49:09.554
He keeps digging like crazy


00:49:09.841 --> 00:49:12.116
He's interfering with our schedule
to store the coal


00:49:12.401 --> 00:49:13.754
Soon snow will cover the mountains


00:49:14.001 --> 00:49:16.390
We must finish storing the coal on time


00:49:16.961 --> 00:49:17.598
Gu


00:49:17.641 --> 00:49:19.677
You can report any issues to
your superiors


00:49:19.721 --> 00:49:21.791
Just don't make trouble here


00:49:21.881 --> 00:49:23.599
I've written nine letters


00:49:24.721 --> 00:49:26.439
Asking others to help me dig


00:49:27.321 --> 00:49:28.595
No one responded


00:49:28.921 --> 00:49:30.639
Even if we all helped digging


00:49:30.681 --> 00:49:31.909
And removed the mountain of coal


00:49:32.201 --> 00:49:34.078
What if there's nothing underneath?


00:49:42.361 --> 00:49:43.919
Then just bury me there


00:49:47.641 --> 00:49:48.835
I told you he was crazy


00:49:50.521 --> 00:49:51.590
Let him be then


00:49:52.601 --> 00:49:54.353
Just don't let him get hurt


00:49:55.801 --> 00:49:57.951
Send him food at meal breaks


00:49:58.041 --> 00:49:59.110
Don't let him starve


00:49:59.201 --> 00:49:59.917
Okay


00:50:01.041 --> 00:50:02.679
Get back to work, hurry


00:50:24.401 --> 00:50:25.914
He lives here


00:50:26.201 --> 00:50:27.714
lt's one of the miner's huts


00:50:29.241 --> 00:50:30.390
ls there heat?


00:50:30.441 --> 00:50:32.159
Fire. Otherwise he'd have frozen to death


00:50:45.201 --> 00:50:47.157
This veteran must really be suffering


00:50:55.081 --> 00:50:56.799
Gu!


00:51:00.201 --> 00:51:01.395
Gu!


00:51:05.521 --> 00:51:06.271
Gu!


00:51:07.241 --> 00:51:08.515
With Liangzi's help


00:51:08.761 --> 00:51:10.717
Er Dou found the 139th Regiment's
Commissar Zhang


00:51:10.961 --> 00:51:12.792
He realized you were still alive


00:51:13.081 --> 00:51:15.641
And that your men were all killed
in battle


00:51:15.961 --> 00:51:17.440
He wanted to meet you


00:51:18.361 --> 00:51:20.750
The military gave an official notice
to the local government


00:51:22.681 --> 00:51:23.636
Your eyesight is poor


00:51:24.681 --> 00:51:26.034
l'll read it to you


00:51:26.081 --> 00:51:26.558
Wait


00:51:28.841 --> 00:51:29.591
Wait


00:51:31.401 --> 00:51:32.754
I have to wash my face first


00:51:54.721 --> 00:51:58.600
Regarding the Central Field Army's
Special 2nd Division


00:51:58.841 --> 00:52:01.036
139th Regiment, 3rd Battalion,
9th Company


00:52:01.121 --> 00:52:03.635
Notification of the Martyrdom
of Revolutionary Heroes


00:52:04.681 --> 00:52:06.114
The Local Government of Wen River County


00:52:06.321 --> 00:52:08.516
Wen River County War Hero Cemetery


00:52:08.761 --> 00:52:10.956
In accordance with the recommendation
of our leaders


00:52:11.641 --> 00:52:13.199
The People's Liberation Army


00:52:13.441 --> 00:52:15.671
Formerly the Central Field Army,
2nd Special Division


00:52:15.921 --> 00:52:18.879
139th Regiment, 3rd Battalion,
9th Company, Political Officer


00:52:20.041 --> 00:52:21.793
Wang Jincun


00:52:23.081 --> 00:52:25.311
Lieutenant Jiao Dapeng


00:52:25.601 --> 00:52:27.432
Soldiers Luo Guangtian


00:52:27.721 --> 00:52:28.756
Lu Kuangou


00:52:29.041 --> 00:52:30.156
Jiang Maocai


00:52:30.441 --> 00:52:31.556
Gong Liangguo


00:52:31.801 --> 00:52:34.315
Meng Shilin etc. Forty seven soldiers


00:52:34.601 --> 00:52:37.718
In the Wen River Battle during
the Civil War in 1948


00:52:37.841 --> 00:52:39.752
Honorably completed their field duty


00:52:40.041 --> 00:52:41.793
All died as heroes


00:52:42.041 --> 00:52:44.396
For the liberation of the Chinese people


00:52:44.481 --> 00:52:46.358
They sacrificed their lives


00:52:46.921 --> 00:52:48.877
Now they are posthumously decorated
as revolutionary heroes


00:52:49.761 --> 00:52:50.671
Special Official Notification


00:52:50.841 --> 00:52:52.832
People's Liberation Army


00:52:53.121 --> 00:52:54.759
Wen River Military, Political Office


00:52:55.001 --> 00:52:57.469
19 Dec 56


00:53:08.041 --> 00:53:10.509
My brothers


00:53:15.721 --> 00:53:17.837
Why can't I find you?


00:53:23.801 --> 00:53:26.156
Come out for a breath of air,
my brothers


00:53:55.561 --> 00:53:57.153
The 9th Company


00:53:57.681 --> 00:54:00.593
In three defensives against the enemy


00:54:02.241 --> 00:54:04.391
Destroyed two enemy tanks


00:54:05.361 --> 00:54:06.237
And killed many enemy troops


00:54:07.401 --> 00:54:09.073
Including Captain Gu Zidi


00:54:09.361 --> 00:54:10.589
Forty seven men


00:54:10.881 --> 00:54:12.439
All perished


00:54:12.761 --> 00:54:14.558
No survivors


00:54:15.561 --> 00:54:16.277
Political Officer


00:54:16.561 --> 00:54:17.880
Wang Jincun


00:54:21.521 --> 00:54:23.398
The lunar calendar's 4th day
of December


00:55:09.801 --> 00:55:10.916
The enemy is attacking again


00:55:11.241 --> 00:55:11.957
Captain


00:55:12.201 --> 00:55:13.475
Do we have any ammo left?


00:55:17.121 --> 00:55:18.634
I can't move my leg.


00:55:22.561 --> 00:55:25.837
The enemy must not get their
hands on our brothers


00:55:34.201 --> 00:55:34.951
Captain


00:55:38.201 --> 00:55:39.793
I didn't disgrace you, did I?


00:56:00.041 --> 00:56:01.872
We'll be brothers in our next life


00:57:59.761 --> 00:58:00.989
Reporting, sir


00:58:01.241 --> 00:58:03.630
Central Plains Field Special
2nd Division


00:58:03.921 --> 00:58:07.241
139th Regiment, 3rd Battalion,
9th Company,
Captain Gu Zidi


00:58:07.241 --> 00:58:08.196
Reporting


00:58:08.401 --> 00:58:09.231
My company


00:58:09.521 --> 00:58:11.751
Was dispatched to the old mine
on the south bank
of the Wen River


00:58:11.961 --> 00:58:15.033
To intercept the enemy's 254th Division


00:58:15.281 --> 00:58:17.237
We destroyed three enemy tanks


00:58:17.521 --> 00:58:19.034
And killed many enemy soldiers


00:58:19.321 --> 00:58:21.710
Except for Captain Gu Zidi


00:58:21.961 --> 00:58:24.316
All forty seven men were killed


00:58:24.601 --> 00:58:25.670
Not one survived


00:58:25.961 --> 00:58:27.030
This concludes my report


00:58:28.001 --> 00:58:28.638
Thank you


00:58:35.281 --> 00:58:37.351
9th Company is assembled


00:58:37.641 --> 00:58:38.960
For your review


00:58:39.361 --> 00:58:41.591
In the battle of Wen River


00:58:41.841 --> 00:58:43.399
The 9th Company resolutely
followed orders


00:58:43.681 --> 00:58:44.750
Honorably completing its duty


00:58:45.041 --> 00:58:47.316
All soldiers in the 9th Company
are awarded


00:58:47.601 --> 00:58:50.957
Medals of Valor


00:59:15.841 --> 00:59:17.240
Heroes of the 9th Company


00:59:19.161 --> 00:59:20.594
You can all rest in peace


00:59:37.241 --> 00:59:38.640
Present arms


00:59:39.321 --> 00:59:40.276
Ready


00:59:41.201 --> 00:59:41.792
Fire


00:59:47.041 --> 00:59:48.110
Ready


00:59:48.481 --> 00:59:49.357
Fire


00:59:52.241 --> 00:59:53.356
Ready


00:59:53.601 --> 00:59:54.351
Fire


00:59:57.201 --> 00:59:58.350
Parade rest


00:59:59.561 --> 01:00:00.596
Bugler


01:00:00.681 --> 01:00:01.352
Yes, sir


01:00:01.521 --> 01:00:01.953
Sound the bugle call


01:00:02.241 --> 01:00:03.117
Yes, sir


01:02:14.241 --> 01:02:28.117
THE END
Subtitles by: Reklame

